{"about_the_game":"<br><br>Join 40+ million players in SMITE, the Battleground of the Gods! Wield Thor\u2019s hammer, turn your foes to stone as Medusa, or flex your divine power as one of 100+ other mythological icons. Become a God and play FREE today!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.poster.avif?t=1764627618\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.webm?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/dcd1cf47dfb98a0b6dffb5babf542ef3.mp4?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash each deity\u2019s unique strategies, legendary weapons, and earth-shattering powers. Rain lightning down upon your foes as Zeus, assassinate from the shadows as Loki, or transform and trick your foes as the Monkey King, Sun Wukong. Which God will you choose?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/4242973c4dd86ac2a251dc7d90db0ee4.poster.avif?t=1764627618\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/4242973c4dd86ac2a251dc7d90db0ee4.webm?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/4242973c4dd86ac2a251dc7d90db0ee4.mp4?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlike other MOBAs, SMITE puts you directly onto the battlefield with a third-person action viewpoint. From blind-side ambushes to aimed shots, a new pantheon of strategic possibilities awaits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/11323d0056631e98a51185ff804b3345.poster.avif?t=1764627618\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/11323d0056631e98a51185ff804b3345.webm?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/386360/extras/11323d0056631e98a51185ff804b3345.mp4?t=1764627618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Never played a battle arena before? Don\u2019t worry. Auto-buy, auto-level, and the deathmatch-like Arena mode let you jump right into divine MOBA action. Aspiring pro? Top the ladders, join a competitive team, and you too could be playing at the SMITE World Championship.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All About the Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/96d05f3668941f61b1629a973c37d9ff95d3256a.jpg"},{"name":"Love to Guard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/1f3228cfabd680212bac3f367689bd79de646355.jpg"},{"name":"Join the Hunt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/06b8f761e73129793f849eff10218004ef5d5d02.jpg"},{"name":"Mage for Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/f52f490b7e9185aef680c6ec9b6effddefc74a79.jpg"},{"name":"Assassin for Hire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/8dcc5ba69285002ae9ac6df81f63fe0722c7c961.jpg"},{"name":"Art of War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/d073531c017bbfab35da5d92d9e25831c2968240.jpg"},{"name":"Blood and Sand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/386360/71caeef77a5b28f215d1176da265022cc7adca